# ============================================================
# 13. Upbit Surge Monitor - OHLCV raw data
# ============================================================
#
# Historical OHLCV is accumulated locally.
#
# Current structure:
#
#   data/ohlcv/h1/
#   data/ohlcv/h4/
#   data/ohlcv/d1/
#
# These files can become very large and must remain local.
#
# IMPORTANT:
#
# recover_history_gaps.py --repair intentionally modifies
# files inside data/ohlcv/.
#
# Because data/ohlcv/ is ignored, actual historical recovery
# must never create Git-visible OHLCV changes.
#
# ============================================================

data/ohlcv/


